### Spatial Fabric SDK UI — Project Structure

- Main UI entrypoints:
  - [run_gradio_ui.py](mdc:run_gradio_ui.py)
  - [spatial_fabric_sdk/launch_gradio_ui.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/launch_gradio_ui.py)
  - UI function exported in [spatial_fabric_sdk/gradio_ui.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/gradio_ui.py) via `gradio_ui()`

- Core SDK package:
  - [spatial_fabric_sdk/](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk)
    - Client and models: [client.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/client.py), [models.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/models.py)
    - SSL/Handle fixes: [ssl_fix.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/ssl_fix.py), [handle_ssl_fix.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/handle_ssl_fix.py)
    - Certs: [certificate_manager.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/certificate_manager.py)
    - Config: [config.py](mdc:spatial_fabric_sdk/config.py)

- Configuration:
  - Default config in [config/config.yaml](mdc:config/config.yaml)

- Documentation and guides:
  - [README.md](mdc:README.md) — features and quickstart
  - [UI_README.md](mdc:UI_README.md) — UI usage
  - [API_QUICK_REFERENCE.md](mdc:API_QUICK_REFERENCE.md)
  - [USER_MANUAL.md](mdc:USER_MANUAL.md)

- Examples and tests:
  - [examples/](mdc:examples)
  - [tests/](mdc:tests)

Notes
- UI startup applies SSL fixes and certificate initialization early in `gradio_ui.py` before other imports.
- Public link support is enabled by passing `share=True` to Gradio in `SpatialFabricGradioUI.launch`.
